# The fallback route, used when the probe in 05- does not answer. Slacker
# keepalives than the cable on purpose; see the mirror of this file on macie.

Host macie
    HostName 100.75.71.79
    User fredrir
    HostKeyAlias macie
    ServerAliveInterval 15
    ServerAliveCountMax 4

# The same route by address; `macie` is only tailscale while the cable is
# out, so it cannot be enrolled as one. Slack keepalives as above, for the
# same reason. HostKeyAlias holds this spelling to the one known_hosts entry
# instead of minting a second.

Host 100.75.71.79
    HostName 100.75.71.79
    User fredrir
    HostKeyAlias macie
    ServerAliveInterval 15
    ServerAliveCountMax 4